(* Corpus triage: Length takes one argument (Length::argx); Part with no index is its argument. *)
(* Head[expr, h] is h[Head[expr]], so Head[Sequence[a, b]] is b[Symbol] (WL 15.0.1, through the Wolfram Cloud MCP); wolfram/Sequence/PossibleIssues/1 shows an older Head::argx. *)
Head[Sequence[a, b]]
Length[a, b]
Part[f[a]]
